{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维治理：可观测性与生产可靠性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observability-tracing","title":"分布式追踪与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/operations/observability-tracing","wordCount":952,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"dlq-retry-strategies","title":"死信队列与重试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/operations/dlq-retry-strategies","wordCount":1357,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"event-governance","title":"事件治理与事件目录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/operations/event-governance","wordCount":1143,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"运维治理-可观测性与生产可靠性\">运维治理：可观测性与生产可靠性</h1><p>本章关注事件驱动微服务在生产环境中的运维保障，涵盖分布式追踪与链路可视化、消息故障处理（DLQ 与重试策略），以及事件目录与治理体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>关键内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分布式追踪与可观测性</td>\n<td>链路追踪</td>\n<td>Correlation ID、OpenTelemetry、Jaeger</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死信队列与重试策略</td>\n<td>故障处理</td>\n<td>DLQ 设计、指数退避、幂等消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件治理与事件目录</td>\n<td>治理体系</td>\n<td>事件 Ownership、SLA 定义、事件目录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"章节定位\">章节定位</h2><p>运维治理是事件驱动系统走向生产可靠性的最后一环。前三章构建了功能层，本章补全了生产运维层：如何发现问题（可观测性）、如何从故障中恢复（DLQ 与重试），以及如何在组织层面管理事件（治理）。</p>\n"}